{430}{}{The Hidden Room}
{530}{}{A room behind a false wall that nobody in the Den knows about. Runaways can hide there, and Metzger's men won't find them when they search. Upkeep +$25/week.}
{431}{}{The Jet Counter}
{531}{}{A counter behind the bar where the Mordinos' Jet changes hands. +$6 side income per customer. Twice as many of our people get hooked, and the Wrights will never forgive it: Jet killed Richard Wright. Upkeep +$25/week.}
